            "pk": "18058191307650323",
            "text": "😍 We invite you to participate in the Women ICT Frontier program! \n \n👩🏻‍💻 The Asian and Pacific Training Centre for ICT for Development (APCICT), in collaboration with MCIAP RK, Astana Hub, and Women in Tech Kazakhstan, presents the exclusive WIFI DX training program, specifically designed to support and empower women entrepreneurs. \n \n📚 The three-day training program offers you the opportunity to gain unique knowledge and skills through the following courses: \n- Foundation Course on Women Empowerment through Business Innovation and Digital Transformation; \n- E-Commerce and Digital Marketing; \n- Data Analytics for Women Entrepreneurs; \n- Business Continuity Planning; \n- Trust and Security in using Digital Technology. \n \n🔹 Participation requirements: \n- Training is conducted exclusively for women entrepreneurs; \n- Proficiency in English (the training will be conducted in English); \n- Ownership of a business. \n \n⚡️ Participation in the program is completely free. The training will take place throughout three days, and your attendance is mandatory. \n \n🗓 September 3-5 \n📍 Media Hall, Astana Hub\n \n💡 Join us to elevate your business to a new level with digital technologies and gain valuable insights from experts! \n \n❗️ Space is limited to just 30 participants, so hurry to apply via the link in the profile description."
